1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,000
Your car doesn't have a transmission dipstick?
You're not imagining things.

2
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:07,000
A lot of newer transmissions are sealed
for life — no dipstick, by design.

3
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:11,000
The fluid level gets checked at a fill plug,
usually from underneath, on a lift.

4
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:15,000
Some also need the fluid at a specific
temperature to get an accurate reading.

5
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:18,000
Fluid looks dark or smells burnt? Worth
checking before it becomes a bigger repair.

6
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:21,000
Nick's Tire and Auto — stop by
and we'll take a look.
